":"This skill is highly valuable for curriculum and instructional-design roles."}]},{"heading":"Assessment Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop competence in creating:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MCQs"},{"text":"Short-answer questions"},{"text":"Case studies"},{"text":"Projects"},{"text":"Practical assessments"},{"text":"Portfolios"},{"text":"Oral assessments"},{"text":"Competency-based assessments"},{"text":"Rubrics"},{"text":"Diagnostic assessments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Assessment quality"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to evaluate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Validity"},{"text":"Reliability"},{"text":"Difficulty"},{"text":"Discrimination"},{"text":"Alignment with learning outcomes"},{"text":"Cognitive level"}]}]},{"heading":"Digital & EdTech Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A modern Curriculum Developer should understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"LMS"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Moodle"},{"text":"Canvas"},{"text":"Google Classroom"},{"text":"Microsoft Teams"},{"text":"Other institutional LMS platforms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Content Tools"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Canva"},{"text":"Google Workspace"},{"text":"Microsoft Office"},{"text":"Interactive presentation tools"},{"text":"Screen-recording tools"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Google Sheets"},{"text":"Basic SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Learning analytics fundamentals"}]}]},{"heading":"AI Skills for Curriculum Developers","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI is becoming an important productivity layer in curriculum development."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to use AI for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Curriculum brainstorming"},{"text":"Lesson-plan generation"},{"text":"Content restructuring"},{"text":"Differentiated learning materials"},{"text":"Question generation"},{"text":"Rubric drafts"},{"text":"Learning-objective mapping"},{"text":"Content summarization"},{"text":"Student-persona creation"},{"text":"Accessibility adaptation"},{"text":"Translation/localization"},{"text":"Learning analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important principle"},{"type":"p","text":"AI-generated educational content must be reviewed by an educator or subject expert."},{"type":"p","text":"The Curriculum Developer remains responsible for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accuracy"},{"text":"Age appropriateness"},{"text":"Pedagogical quality"},{"text":"Bias"},{"text":"Curriculum alignment"},{"text":"Assessment validity"},{"text":"Copyright/IP considerations"}]}]},{"heading":"Emerging AI-Education Workflow","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A modern workflow can look like:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Curriculum Framework","Learning Outcomes","AI-Assisted Content Drafting","Expert Review","Learning Activity Design","Assessment Generation","Human Quality Assurance","Pilot Testing","Learning Analytics","Curriculum Improvement"]}]},{"heading":"Projects During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A student should build a portfolio rather than relying only on academic marks."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Complete Curriculum Unit"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a 4–6 week curriculum unit including:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Learning outcomes"},{"text":"Lesson plans"},{"text":"Activities"},{"text":"Resources"},{"text":"Assessments"},{"text":"Rubrics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Digital Learning Module"},{"type":"p","text":"Create an online learning module using an LMS or content platform."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Question Bank"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a structured question bank mapped to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Topic"},{"text":"Learning outcome"},{"text":"Difficulty"},{"text":"Bloom's level"},{"text":"Question type"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Remedial Learning Program"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a learning intervention for students struggling with a particular topic."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Competency-Based Curriculum"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a curriculum around measurable competencies rather than only chapter completion."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — AI-Assisted Curriculum Prototype"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a curriculum development workflow using AI for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Content drafts"},{"text":"Differentiated activities"},{"text":"Assessments"},{"text":"Teacher resources"},{"text":"with human review and validation."}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target organizations such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Schools"},{"text":"EdTech companies"},{"text":"Educational publishers"},{"text":"Curriculum organizations"},{"text":"Teacher-training organizations"},{"text":"Assessment companies"},{"text":"NGOs"},{"text":"Education-focused research organizations"},{"text":"Learning-content companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship titles"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Curriculum Intern"},{"text":"Academic Content Intern"},{"text":"Instructional Design Intern"},{"text":"Content Development Intern"},{"text":"Subject Matter Expert Intern"},{"text":"Learning Experience Intern"},{"text":"Assessment Development Intern"},{"text":"Education Research Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Deliverables","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Try to graduate with evidence of actual curriculum work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"1 Curriculum Map"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"3–5 Lesson Plans"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"1 Complete Learning Module"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"1 Assessment Blueprint"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"1 Question Bank"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"1 Rubric Framework"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"1 Educational Research Project"},{"text":"This creates a strong academic portfolio."}]}]},{"heading":"Employer Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Employer Type","Important Skills"],"rows":[