},{"text":"Educational Technology"},{"text":"Assessment & Evaluation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA Education Management"},{"text":"MBA/PGDM in EdTech or related management areas"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Phil/Ph.D. pathways where applicable"},{"text":"Ph.D. in Education"},{"text":"Ph.D. in Curriculum & Instruction"},{"text":"Educational Technology research"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Curriculum Developer can specialize in:"},{"type":"h","text":"1. School Curriculum"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop K–12 curricula, textbooks, lesson plans and teacher resources."},{"type":"h","text":"2. EdTech Curriculum"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop digital courses and online learning experiences."},{"type":"h","text":"3. Assessment Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Build assessments, question banks and competency frameworks."},{"type":"h","text":"4. STEM Curriculum"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop science, mathematics, technology and engineering learning programs."},{"type":"h","text":"5. Language Curriculum"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop language-learning programs and communication curricula."},{"type":"h","text":"6. Inclusive Curriculum"},{"type":"p","text":"Design accessible learning experiences for diverse learners."},{"type":"h","text":"7. Teacher Education"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop teacher-training programs and professional-development content."},{"type":"h","text":"8. Learning Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Use student performance data to improve curriculum effectiveness."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"0–2 Years"},{"type":"flow","items":["Teacher / Academic Content Associate","2–5 Years"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Curriculum Developer / Instructional Designer","5–8 Years"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Senior Curriculum Developer","8–12 Years"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Curriculum Lead / Academic Lead","12+ Years"]},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Head of Curriculum / Academic Director"},{"text":"The exact timeline varies substantially by organization and experience."}]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Future Curriculum Developers should monitor:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"AI tutoring systems"},{"text":"Adaptive learning"},{"text":"Learning analytics"},{"text":"AI-powered assessment"},{"text":"Personalized learning"},{"text":"Extended reality (AR/VR)"},{"text":"Simulation-based learning"},{"text":"Digital credentials"},{"text":"Competency-based education platforms"},{"text":"Learning experience platforms"},{"text":"AI-powered content authoring"},{"text":"Multilingual AI education"},{"text":"Accessibility technologies"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile at Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate should be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Explain major learning theories"},{"text":"Design structured lessons"},{"text":"Define measurable learning outcomes"},{"text":"Map curriculum to competencies"},{"text":"Develop teaching-learning materials"},{"text":"Create assessments"},{"text":"Build rubrics"},{"text":"Design digital learning modules"},{"text":"Understand inclusive education"},{"text":"Conduct basic educational research"},{"text":"Analyze basic learning data"},{"text":"Use AI responsibly for curriculum development"},{"text":"Present curriculum proposals professionally"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The student should graduate with a digital portfolio containing:"},{"type":"table","header":["Portfolio Item","Demonstrates"],"rows":[[{"text":"Curriculum Map"},{"text":"Curriculum design"}],[{"text":"Lesson Plans"},{"text":"Pedagogy"}],[{"text":"Digital Module"},{"text":"EdTech"}],[{"text":"Question Bank"},{"text":"Assessment"}],[{"text":"Rubric"},{"text":"Evaluation"}],[{"text":